  "description": "IHEMIU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C126 H79 Ce3 Cl15 Mn8 O46,2.5(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn5 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn6 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn7 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn8 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 26 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.150-4.051 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.24-126.39°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ce3Mn8O8(2-Cl-PhCO2)15.3(PhCO2)2.7(H2O)2]·2.5MeCN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
